# Route: guide 15 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 37 to
# 39, 21 quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Badlands): Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley
# of Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> The Maker's Terrace ->
# Agmond's End -> The Dustbowl -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> Hammertoe's
# Digsite -> Valley of Fangs -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Black Box (708; Zaricotl
# 55-56).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1559 Flash Bomb
# Recipe.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862).

